 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Common uses of «ci»",
     "texto": [
      "**Ci** refers back to a place (**Ci vado**) or to a topic introduced by **a** (**Ci credo**, **Non ci penso**). In **ci metto**, it indicates the time needed; **ci vuole** is singular, and **ci vogliono** is plural."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Combinations with «avere»",
     "texto": [
      "Before **lo/la/li/le**, **gli/le** becomes **glie-**: **Gliel'ho detto**. With **ci + lo/la** it is written **ce l'ho**, with an apostrophe.",
      "If a direct pronoun comes before the passato prossimo, the past participle agrees with that object: **Le ho comprate**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Example",
